{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106700","id":2535727607,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6XJCH3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106700","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106700.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106700","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106700/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106700/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106700/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a9a28548ca935a08239418cf001d429dbbf6b50a","number":106700,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Ogg Theora support to MovieWriter","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Movie Maker mode can now record files in `.ogv` format, which can be directly viewed in Godot's VideoStreamPlayer node along with most video players. This is a lossy format with inter-frame compression, unlike AVI + MJPEG which only performs intra-frame compression.\r\n\r\nThanks to @penninghlhd for the initial implementation from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98416 :slightly_smiling_face:\r\n\r\nI've copied the code over, rebased it on top of `master` and tweaked the code style to match the code style guidelines. I've left some review comments accordingly where there are still open questions.\r\n\r\nTheora information from ffprobe with the default settings:\r\n\r\n```\r\nInput #0, ogg, from 'out.ogv':\r\n  Duration: N/A, start: 0.000000, bitrate: N/A\r\n  Stream #0:0: Video: theora, yuv420p, 1280x720 [SAR 1:1 DAR 16:9], 60 fps, 60 tbr, 60 tbn\r\n  Stream #0:1: Audio: vorbis, 48000 Hz, stereo, fltp, 160 kb/s\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** https://github.com/Calinou/godot-movie-maker-demo\r\n\r\nRegarding encoding performance, I've only tested it on a debug build so far, but OGV encoding is significantly slower than AVI + MJPEG with the default quality:\r\n\r\n### AVI\r\n\r\n```\r\n1800 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:30:00), recorded in 00:00:36 (83% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.50 seconds (average: 0.28 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 6.49 seconds (average: 3.61 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### OGV\r\n\r\n```\r\n1800 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:30:00), recorded in 00:00:57 (52% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 0.70 seconds (average: 0.39 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 7.01 seconds (average: 3.90 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis means that for quick previewing and further video editing, AVI + MJPEG is still preferred.\r\n\r\n## TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] Fix files being corrupted.\r\n  - mpv prints this when playing the video: `[ffmpeg/demuxer] ogg: Broken file, keyframe not correctly marked.`.\r\n- [ ] Fix compilation when using `builtin_libtheora=no builtin_libvorbis=no builtin_libogg=no` (undefined references).\r\n- [ ] Test on Windows + MSVC and make sure the Theora files are correct once they're fixed on other platforms. MSVC uses a different set of files for x86 intrinsics in Theora.\r\n- [ ] Move MovieWriterOGV to the `modules/theora` module it depends on, like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106013.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-22T00:35:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T23:28:46Z","closed_at":"2025-06-05T23:23:43Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Calinou:moviewriter-add-theora","ref":"moviewriter-add-theora","repo":{"id":59436050,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk1OTQzNjA1MA==","name":"godot","full_name":"Calinou/godot","owner":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user